{"2706660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dragon survival", "steam_appid": 2706660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706660/extras/01755e8ce5ad5c0e57903af9d917f51f.poster.avif?t=1769997526\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706660/extras/01755e8ce5ad5c0e57903af9d917f51f.webm?t=1769997526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706660/extras/01755e8ce5ad5c0e57903af9d917f51f.mp4?t=1769997526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve crash-landed on a floating island—and survival is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a stranded hunter, you must team up with <strong>Ignis</strong>, a young dragon, to challenge the island’s powerful rulers and collect the mana needed to escape. <br>But this is no ordinary island. It’s a living, breathing world filled with untamed nature, fearsome monsters, and ancient knowledge waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706660/extras/9ed539e9a924efa3aa9a2fcf43209568.webp?t=1769997526\" width=706 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706660/extras/486a0e64cff83fa80fd62e9c7a97d5d5.poster.avif?t=1769997526\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706660/extras/486a0e64cff83fa80fd62e9c7a97d5d5.webm?t=1769997526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706660/extras/486a0e64cff83fa80fd62e9c7a97d5d5.mp4?t=1769997526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Global Exploration &amp; Shifting Climates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is not one island—it’s many.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lush forests, arid deserts, frozen tundras, and molten lava fields... <br>Each island presents <strong>a unique survival challenge</strong>, with different climates, resources, crafting recipes, and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your strategy must evolve with every new environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(The demo includes the temperate forest island.)</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706660/extras/9ed539e9a924efa3aa9a2fcf43209568.webp?t=1769997526\" width=706 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706660/extras/1da70003405017a19944b77b7942a20e.poster.avif?t=1769997526\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706660/extras/1da70003405017a19944b77b7942a20e.webm?t=1769997526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706660/extras/1da70003405017a19944b77b7942a20e.mp4?t=1769997526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival, Crafting, and Base Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge weapons, strengthen your armor, and build a shelter to survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where resources are scarce, only those who <strong>craft what they need</strong> can survive. <br>Everything—your tools, your base, your survival—must be built with your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706660/extras/9ed539e9a924efa3aa9a2fcf43209568.webp?t=1769997526\" width=706 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decode the Lorestones</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered across the islands are <strong>Lorestones</strong>, ancient relics left behind by explorers before you. <br>Inside them lie forgotten recipes, hidden clues, and survival secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only by decoding their messages can you unlock the <strong>sealed Gates of the Island’s Rulers</strong> and move forward on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706660/extras/9ed539e9a924efa3aa9a2fcf43209568.webp?t=1769997526\" width=706 height=54 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face the Island Rulers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each island awaits a powerful boss with unique patterns and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating them is the only way to unlock the path to the next island. <br>Stand your ground—and fight alongside your dragon companion—to overcome the rulers of these wild lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706660/extras/01755e8ce5ad5c0e57903af9d917f51f.poster.avif?t=1769997526\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706660/extras/01755e8ce5ad5c0e57903af9d917f51f.webm?t=1769997526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706660/extras/01755e8ce5ad5c0e57903af9d917f51f.mp4?t=1769997526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve crash-landed on a floating island—and survival is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a stranded hunter, you must team up with <strong>Ignis</strong>, a young dragon, to challenge the island’s powerful rulers and collect the mana needed to escape. <br>But this is no ordinary island. It’s a living, breathing world filled with untamed nature, fearsome monsters, and ancient knowledge waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706660/extras/9ed539e9a924efa3aa9a2fcf43209568.webp?t=1769997526\" width=706 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706660/extras/486a0e64cff83fa80fd62e9c7a97d5d5.poster.avif?t=1769997526\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706660/extras/486a0e64cff83fa80fd62e9c7a97d5d5.webm?t=1769997526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706660/extras/486a0e64cff83fa80fd62e9c7a97d5d5.mp4?t=1769997526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Global Exploration &amp; Shifting Climates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is not one island—it’s many.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lush forests, arid deserts, frozen tundras, and molten lava fields... <br>Each island presents <strong>a unique survival challenge</strong>, with different climates, resources, crafting recipes, and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your strategy must evolve with every new environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(The demo includes the temperate forest island.)</