_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706660/extras/9ed539e9a924efa3aa9a2fcf43209568.webp?t=1769997526\" width=706 height=54 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face the Island Rulers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each island awaits a powerful boss with unique patterns and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating them is the only way to unlock the path to the next island. <br>Stand your ground—and fight alongside your dragon companion—to overcome the rulers of these wild lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Stranded on a mysterious island with a baby dragon, survive and grow stronger. Gather resources, build your base, and overcome trials left behind by ancient explorers. An open-world survival RPG blending exploration, crafting, combat, and dragon growth.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706660/6efff32538d69762c1650a77cec9133f83299ec0/header.jpg?t=1769997526", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706660/4878cd447932493bda27d0ade7658eb553f6b20f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769997526", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706660/4878cd447932493bda27d0ade7658eb553f6b20f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769997526", "website": "https://impress.games/press-kit/depth/dragon-survival", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-6400  / AMD Ryzen 5 1500X <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 / AMD Radeon RX 580  / Intel ARC A380<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version